title: Piłsudczycy leave the PPS
subtitle: The Piłsudski-oriented current breaks with the party.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: polish_faction_system and pilsudczycy_dissent >= 60 and not pilsudczycy_split
on-arrival: {!
Q.pilsudczycy_split = 1;
Q.pilsudczycy_strength /= 2;
Q.workers_pps -= 3;
Q.new_middle_pps -= 2;
Q.workers_other += 3;
Q.new_middle_other += 2;
for (var adviser of ['jaworowski', 'moraczewski', 'malinowski']) {
    if (Q[adviser + '_advisor']) {
        Q[adviser + '_advisor'] = 0;
        Q.n_advisors -= 1;
    }
    Q[adviser + '_left_adviser_pool'] = 1;
}
!}
max-visits: 1

= The Piłsudczyk current breaks away

The Piłsudski-oriented current has left the PPS. Its remaining strength inside the party is halved. Rajmund Jaworowski, Jędrzej Moraczewski and Marian Malinowski leave the adviser pool; Bronisław Ziemięcki remains available. Some worker and intelligentsia support moves to unspecified government-aligned alternatives.

PPS–dawna Frakcja Rewolucyjna, Sanacja and direct cooperation with a government camp remain planned until those parties and chronology are implemented.

- @root: Continue
